{"seq":1,"slug":"functional-harmony","title":"功能和声与进行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/functional-harmony","wordCount":1510,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"功能和声与进行模型\">功能和声与进行模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>功能和声把调内所有和弦归入三种功能——主（T）、下属（S）、属（D）——并用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\to S \\to D \\to T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的有序流动解释调性音乐的动力学：从稳定出发，经过渡区到达最大张力点，再回归稳定。掌握这套模型要抓住三层：功能分类、以终止式为&quot;标点&quot;的句法，以及在此基础上叠加半音色彩的二次属和弦。后文的常用进行、和声节奏与二次属，都是这一主干道在不同尺度上的具体化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"和弦功能的三分法\">和弦功能的三分法</h2><p>功能和声理论（Functional Harmony）将调内所有和弦归入三种基本功能类别：<strong>主功能</strong>（Tonic, T）、<strong>属功能</strong>（Dominant, D）、<strong>下属功能</strong>（Subdominant, S）。这三种功能之间的有序流动构成了调性音乐的基本动力学。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\to S \\to D \\to T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是功能和声的&quot;主干道&quot;——从稳定出发，经过过渡区域，到达最大张力点，最终回归稳定。虽然实际音乐远比这个模型复杂，但几乎所有调性音乐的和声骨架都可以还原为这一基本逻辑的某种变体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    T[&quot;T 主功能&lt;br/&gt;I, iii, vi&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;S 下属功能&lt;br/&gt;IV, ii&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; D[&quot;D 属功能&lt;br/&gt;V, vii°&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; T&#10;    T --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    T[\"T 主功能&lt;br/&gt;I, iii, vi\"] --&gt; S[\"S 下属功能&lt;br/&gt;IV, ii\"]\n    S --&gt; D[\"D 属功能&lt;br/&gt;V, vii°\"]\n    D --&gt; T\n    T --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>核心和弦</th>\n<th>替代和弦</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主 (T)</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>iii, vi</td>\n<td>稳定、安息感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下属 (S)</td>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>ii</td>\n<td>过渡、离开感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属 (D)</td>\n<td>V, V7</td>\n<td>vii°</td>\n<td>紧张、趋向回归</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"终止式体系\">终止式体系</h2><p>终止式（Cadence）是乐句结尾处的和声公式，起着&quot;标点符号&quot;的作用。四种基本终止式：</p>\n<p><strong>正格终止</strong>（Authentic Cadence）：V → I，最强的&quot;句号&quot;效果。若外声部（女高音与低音）都级进到主音，称为&quot;完全正格终止&quot;（PAC）——调性音乐中最具决定性的结束标志。</p>\n<p><strong>半终止</strong>（Half Cadence）：任何和弦 → V，在属和弦上停住，形成&quot;逗号&quot;效果——悬而未决，暗示后续还有内容。</p>\n<p><strong>变格终止</strong>（Plagal Cadence）：IV → I，也称&quot;阿门终止&quot;，在教堂圣歌结尾大量使用。力度弱于正格终止。</p>\n<p><strong>阻碍终止</strong>（Deceptive Cadence）：V → vi（或其他非主和弦），制造意外——听众期待解决到 I，却被带往意料之外的方向。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PAC: </mtext><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><mi>I</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>最强终止力</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PAC: } V^7 \\to I \\quad (\\text{最强终止力})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PAC: </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最强终止力</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>IAC: </mtext><mi>V</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>I</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>外声部非级进到主音</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IAC: } V \\to I \\quad (\\text{外声部非级进到主音})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IAC: </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">外声部非级进到主音</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HC: </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">?</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>V</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>句中停顿</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HC: } ? \\to V \\quad (\\text{句中停顿})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HC: </span></span><span class=\"mclose\">?</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">句中停顿</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DC: </mtext><mi>V</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>欺骗性意外</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DC: } V \\to vi \\quad (\\text{欺骗性意外})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DC: </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">欺骗性意外</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"常用和声进行套路\">常用和声进行套路</h2><p>流行音乐中大量作品建立在有限的几种和声进行之上。这些进行之所以&quot;好听&quot;，源于功能关系的合理流动与人耳的习惯化期待：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>进行名称</th>\n<th>罗马数字</th>\n<th>C大调示例</th>\n<th>代表作品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;四和弦万能进行&quot;</td>\n<td>I-V-vi-IV</td>\n<td>C-G-Am-F</td>\n<td>&quot;Let It Be&quot;, &quot;No Woman No Cry&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;50年代进行&quot;</td>\n<td>I-vi-IV-V</td>\n<td>C-Am-F-G</td>\n<td>&quot;Stand By Me&quot;, 无数金曲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Canon 进行</td>\n<td>I-V-vi-iii-IV-I-IV-V</td>\n<td>C-G-Am-Em-F-C-F-G</td>\n<td>&quot;Canon in D&quot;, &quot;Let It Go&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小调悲伤进行</td>\n<td>vi-IV-I-V</td>\n<td>Am-F-C-G</td>\n<td>&quot;Someone Like You&quot;, &quot;Faded&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>爵士 ii-V-I</td>\n<td>ii-V-I</td>\n<td>Dm7-G7-Cmaj7</td>\n<td>几乎所有爵士标准曲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布鲁斯进行</td>\n<td>I7-IV7-V7</td>\n<td>C7-F7-G7</td>\n<td>12小节布鲁斯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 四和弦万能进行&#10;        I[&quot;I (C)&quot;] --&gt; V[&quot;V (G)&quot;]&#10;        V --&gt; vi[&quot;vi (Am)&quot;]&#10;        vi --&gt; IV[&quot;IV (F)&quot;]&#10;        IV --&gt; I&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 四和弦万能进行\n        I[\"I (C)\"] --&gt; V[\"V (G)\"]\n        V --&gt; vi[\"vi (Am)\"]\n        vi --&gt; IV[\"IV (F)\"]\n        IV --&gt; I\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"二次属和弦\">二次属和弦</h2><p>二次属和弦（Secondary Dominant）是功能和声中最重要的半音化手段。原理：调内任何一个和弦都可以临时充当&quot;局部主和弦&quot;，在它前面放置它自己的属七和弦以强化进入的方向感。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>属和弦的属和弦</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mn>7</mn><mtext>（在 C 大调中）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^7/V = \\text{属和弦的属和弦} = D7 \\text{（在 C 大调中）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">属和弦的属和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（在</span><span class=\"mord\"> C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大调中）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>II 级的属和弦</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mn>7</mn><mtext>（在 C 大调中）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^7/ii = \\text{II 级的属和弦} = A7 \\text{（在 C 大调中）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ii</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">II </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">级的属和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（在</span><span class=\"mord\"> C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大调中）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>常用的二次属和弦：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标记</th>\n<th>C大调中的实际和弦</th>\n<th>解决目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>V7/ii</td>\n<td>A7</td>\n<td>Dm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V7/iii</td>\n<td>B7</td>\n<td>Em</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V7/IV</td>\n<td>C7</td>\n<td>F</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V7/V</td>\n<td>D7</td>\n<td>G</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V7/vi</td>\n<td>E7</td>\n<td>Am</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>二次属和弦为调内和声增添了半音色彩与方向性，是从&quot;纯白键&quot;和声走向色彩和声的第一步。Beatles 的大量作品（如&quot;Something&quot;、&quot;Michelle&quot;）中穿插使用二次属和弦来增强旋律的色彩感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"和声节奏与结构塑造\">和声节奏与结构塑造</h2><p>和声节奏（Harmonic Rhythm）指和弦变化的频率——每小节换几次和弦。和声节奏的快慢直接影响音乐的运动感与张力水平：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>慢和声节奏</strong>（2-4 小节一个和弦）：安静、空旷、冥想感。Ambient、Drone 音乐。</li>\n<li><strong>中等和声节奏</strong>（每小节 1 个和弦）：大多数流行音乐的标准配置。</li>\n<li><strong>快和声节奏</strong>（每拍或每半拍换和弦）：紧迫、戏剧性。Bebop 爵士、古典终止序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>和声节奏的加密与放缓是曲式结构的重要塑造手段。典型模式：主歌使用较慢的和声节奏（营造铺垫感），副歌或终止前加密和声节奏（推高能量），尾声回到缓慢的和声节奏（逐渐平息）。</p>\n<p>2024-2025 年的流行音乐趋势显示，极简和声节奏（整首歌仅 2-4 个和弦循环）与极密和声节奏（受爵士影响的 R&amp;B）同时并行发展，形成两极化的听觉审美。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调内和弦归为 T / S / D 三功能，主干道是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\to S \\to D \\to T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>终止式是乐句的标点：正格（句号）、半终止（逗号）、变格（阿门）、阻碍（意外）。</li>\n<li>流行音乐高度依赖有限几种进行，其&quot;好听&quot;源于功能流动与听觉习惯。</li>\n<li>二次属和弦是走向色彩和声的第一步，为任何和弦临时架设自己的 V7。</li>\n<li>和声节奏（换和弦的频率）是塑造张力与曲式的隐形工具。</li>\n<li>快慢两极化（极简循环 vs 爵士化加密）是当代流行的并行趋势。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>功能和声的三种功能分类建立在调内各级和弦之上，先掌握和弦构成：<a href=\"../chord-construction/triads\">三和弦的构成与分类</a></li>\n<li>本节是流行与古典常用进行的理论框架，配合实例曲目深入：<a href=\"common-progressions\">流行与古典常用和声进行</a></li>\n<li>和声节奏的曲式塑造作用在专章中展开，并与节拍层级互动：<a href=\"harmonic-rhythm\">和声节奏与曲式结构</a></li>\n<li>调性与终止式离不开调式系统，回顾大小调与调式基础：<a href=\"../../music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/modes-basics\">调式基础</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"功能和声与进行模型","id":"功能和声与进行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"和弦功能的三分法","id":"和弦功能的三分法"},{"level":2,"text":"终止式体系","id":"终止式体系"},{"level":2,"text":"常用和声进行套路","id":"常用和声进行套路"},{"level":2,"text":"二次属和弦","id":"二次属和弦"},{"level":2,"text":"和声节奏与结构塑造","id":"和声节奏与结构塑造"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"延伸和弦与复杂结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/extended-chords"},"next":{"title":"流行与古典常用和声进行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/common-progressions"}}